  "description": "⚒️ **Founded: 25-08-2024** ⚒️\n\n🌍 Timezone: GMT+2\n\n════════════════════════\n\n📩 **Applying**:\n\n- DISCORD IS REQUIRED &amp; MANDATORY\n- Combat LVL 90+\n- Guild Discord: DM pyrrhanikos2480 or desskit or chill_ac on discord.\n\n════════════════════════\n\n📖 **Guild Guidelines**:\n\n- Building up a community and helping each other is more important than playing the game - this is why we require discord.\n- We are a resilient guild with a semi-long history of ups and downs. We have survived so far and we aren&#039;t giving up. \n- Higher level players will handle challenges and marks, but not participating in raids or signs of prolonged inactivity leads to exclusion.\n\n\n════════════════════════\n\n⚔️ **Daily Guild Activities and Services**:\n\n- daily raid or conquest\n- world boss pings (discord)\n- free Forge service, you provide recipe and materials (legendary: Chilleane, mythic: Mithrax)\n- Meditation buff service, this is a timed buff so discord is required for coordination (Akazawa)\n- free Alchemy service, you provide materials (wraithbane and below: Chilleane)\n- free House guest service (Chilleane - dungeons &amp; pets, Desskit - fishing &amp; cooking)",
